{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":11,"result_bytes":370,"result_hash":"sha256:8f38d7fd9cf4bd730341386c551e504c53978ea98cdd9ce1d0225c70bea82147","result_inline":"1\t# Error codes\n2\t\n3\tEvery code cartctl can print, in the format `error <code>: <message>`.\n4\t\n5\t| code | message | when |\n6\t|---|---|---|\n7\t| E_UNKNOWN_SKU | unknown sku | the sku is not in the catalogue |\n8\t| E_EMPTY_CART | cart is empty | checkout was asked for an empty cart |\n9\t| E_USAGE | usage: cartctl add <sku> <qty> | the command line could not be parsed |\n10\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:c76e4e89ef7f83ff7ec53617a67bbb76fa0cb7ff41d088485780190a12b108c1","mono_ns":12000000,"prev":"sha256:700e526cfa1f97fb3968597babdc1ec31abf623861409f5bdd16cbb85f8fac33","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":12,"session":"1f43b662-0f57-4217-99ac-2dd6b43c6e2f","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.012Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
